<title>UK: SOCCER-LEAGUE CUP FINAL REPLAY GOES TO EXTRA TIME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEAGUE CUP FINAL REPLAY GOES TO EXTRA TIME.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Middlesbrough and Leicester were drawing 0-0 after 90 minutes of the English League Cup final replay on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Extra time was being played.</p>
</text>
